WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.030 --> 00:00:07.800
Move a lead through the stages and log calls, meetings and viewings on its timeline.

2
00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:11.200
Here are the new leads. Open one.

3
00:00:14.250 --> 00:00:20.820
The stages run from New to Signed. Click a stage to move the lead there.

4
00:00:20.820 --> 00:00:25.580
We called them, so we move it to Contacted.

5
00:00:25.580 --> 00:00:30.620
The stage changed, and the move is recorded on the timeline.

6
00:00:30.620 --> 00:00:36.420
Log what happened: a call, an email, a meeting or a viewing.

7
00:00:40.900 --> 00:00:44.130
Add it to the timeline.

8
00:00:44.130 --> 00:00:51.860
The timeline keeps every call, email and change, so anyone on the team can pick up the deal.

9
00:00:51.860 --> 00:00:58.210
The pipeline shows the same leads as cards you can drag from stage to stage.
